# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Bulk audio & external datasets — regenerable or re-downloadable, never commit.
# Manifests (pairs_manifest.json) ARE committed; only the audio payload is not.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
fma_medium.zip
fma_metadata/
raw_audio/
perturbations/audio/
perturbations_temporal/audio/
*.wav
*.mp3
*.flac
*.ogg
*.zip

# Model weights / HF caches (live on the GPU box, never in the repo)
*.safetensors
*.ckpt
*.pt
*.bin
hf_cache/
.cache/huggingface/
huggingface/

# Cached embedding tensors — derived payload, not results. Regenerable on CPU:
#   scripts/analysis/clap_probe.py extract   (~8 min, no GPU, downloads CLAP to ~/.cache)
# The probe's actual results (clap_probe*.json) ARE committed; the 8.6 MB tensor is not.
*.npz
*.npy

